t=\"Omicron｜5個常見錯誤居家清潔行為（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220114/558715723606921216307268.jpeg/pMB3PheWLDxunNBZSjFRKIw2vUZTdBi7ns6Iap7OiGo\"/><figcaption>Omicron｜5個常見錯誤居家清潔行為（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Omicron｜5個常見錯誤居家清潔行為（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220114/558715725645484032065149.jpeg/0iPYAFIHyVjr2qJmhxrhosdiuTDvKDSEkQ0eCJENHgg\"/><figcaption>Omicron｜5個常見錯誤居家清潔行為（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Omicron｜5個常見錯誤居家清潔行為（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220114/558715727885373440568402.jpeg/5W2No06LYUF4JVzkYcPYa7vH7uUAHqsoUNNWnlDTVp4\"/><figcaption>Omicron｜5個常見錯誤居家清潔行為（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲《聯合早報》授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-18T11:20:02.073154+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1888,"images":22,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none"}}